# Project scope

Internal Support Messenger. Roles: Admin, Agent, Contact. **This repo is Expo-only.** Next.js, NestJS, and Postgres live elsewhere.

Do not build: Instagram stories, case-status rail/stepper, Casewire branding.

Offers = in-app promo carousel + shared group chat `id: 'offers'`. `"Sponsored"` is a label. Not stories, not an ad SDK, not checkout.

Slim Admin on mobile: Home hub / users / unassigned / conversations / settings. Home hub may show **mock** charts + knowledge + add-offer. No real analytics, audit log UI, or SLA config here.

Contact hub: **no tab bar**. Gear → settings. Messages/Help/Search/Settings are stack pushes with back. Search is its own screen (not Help FAQ). Agent tabs: Home | Unassigned | Conversations. Admin tabs: Home | Users | Unassigned | Conversations. Settings is hub gear only.

Current phase: `AGENTS.md` + `docs/scope.md` (Phase 2 mock auth + role hubs). Do not implement a later phase’s packages or screens just because they appear in the SOW.
